  "operation": {
    "kind": "prompt",
    "user": "Judge the acceptance suite.\n\n## The tests\n\n{{.inputs.acceptance_tests}}\n\n## The results\n\n{{.inputs.results}}\n\n## What breaking the feature showed\n\n{{.inputs.diagnosability}}\n\n## The feature\n\n{{.inputs.feature}}\n\n## What the unit tests cover\n\n{{.inputs.covered}}\n\n## The previous pass\n\n{{.inputs.prior_findings}}\n\n## What to check\n\n- Every claim in the story and the metrics has a test, or is named as unverified.\n- Each test asserts the success signal, not an intermediate.\n- Each test drives the system the way the person does.\n- Nothing re-asserts a unit invariant.\n- Every mutation was caught, and the failure said what broke.\n\n## What to produce\n\n`findings`: each `{ severity, claim, evidence, target_id }`.\n\n`max_severity`, `max_severity_rank` (blocker 3, significant 2, minor 1, note 0).\n\n`target`: `draft` when the tests should change; `upstream` when the feature or a pattern is wrong; `ask` when a person has to decide.\n",
    "config": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5"
    },
    "input": {},
    "output": {
      "name": "output",
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "findings": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "severity",
                "claim"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "severity": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "blocker",
                    "significant",
                    "minor",
                    "note"
                  ]
                },
                "claim": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "evidence": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "target_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "max_severity": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "blocker",
              "significant",
              "minor",
              "note"
            ]
          },
          "max_severity_rank": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "target": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "draft",
              "explore",
              "upstream",
              "ask"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "findings",
          "max_severity",
          "max_severity_rank",
          "target"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "environment": {
    "session": null
  },
  "scopeSession": null,
  "slotMeta": {
    "inputs.acceptance_tests": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "inputs.results": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "inputs.diagnosability": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "inputs.covered": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "inputs.severity_threshold": {
      "default": "significant"
    },
    "inputs.prior_findings": {
      "optional": true
    }
  }
}
